[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（英音）]
[ti:Expensive and Uncomfortable]
[00:15.22]What did the man in this story do?
[00:21.10]When a plane from London arrived at Sydney airport,
[00:25.78]workers began to unload a number of wooden boxes which contained clothing.
[00:33.27]No one could account for the fact that one of the boxes was extremely heavy.
[00:41.72]It suddenly occurred to one of the workers to open up the box.
[00:46.71]He was astonished at what he found.
[00:50.50]A man was lying in the box on top of a pile of woollen goods.
[00:57.15]He was so surprised at being discovered
[01:00.38]that he did not even try to run away.
[01:04.56]After he was arrested,
[01:07.01]the man admitted hiding in the box before the plane left London.
[01:12.75]He had had a long and uncomfortable trip,
[01:16.78]for he had been confined to the wooden box for over eighteen hours.
[01:23.02]The man was ordered to pay ￡3, 500 for
[01:28.63]the cost of the trip.
[01:31.19]The normal price of a ticket is ￡2, 000!
